     3918       if not first( legacy-obj.d-card ) then do:
     3919       UNDERLINE stream PrnLibStream   ub.dis-obj.d-card   ub.dis-obj.obj-code   sj-cards.cli-name   FOR-d-pcnt   TotalSum   DiscSum   NettoSum   InstantPaySUm   CreditSum   PaySUmStr   SaldoSumStr   MustPayStr   ub.dis-obj.num-chk   With frame X123.
     3920       end.
